    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my left calf has been really swollen and tender for like two days now. it's kind of painful to touch. i've also been feeling a bit short of breath today and my chest feels a little tight. do u think this is just anxiety from work stress? i've been super stressed lately.",
