    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that makes me feel a lot better. i knew i was just overthinking everything. i really don't have time to deal with a doctor right now though, i have so much on my plate. since it's probably just muscle tightness, is there something i can take to get the swelling in my leg down quickly? like a strong anti-inflammatory or something?",
